            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Fan Bolt"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "The hunter prepares their hooked crossbow bolts with carefully woven seaweed. On a successful crossbow Strike, the bolt embeds and the seaweed fan deploys. The target takes a \u201310-foot status penalty to its swim Speed. A creature can Interact to attempt a DC Athletics check, removing the bolt on a success."
            },
            "id": "9cac2785-9614-46a5-b363-0afd278afab6",
